  "notes": [
    "**Recordar** is a stem-changing verb: o→ue",
    "Present: stem change o→ue (except nosotros)",
    "Preterite: regular -AR endings, NO stem change",
    "Imperfect: regular -AR pattern, NO stem change",
    "Future: regular future endings, NO stem change",
    "Multiple meanings:",
    "To remember: *Recuerdo ese día* (I remember that day)",
    "To remind: *Me recuerda a mi abuela* (It reminds me of my grandmother)",
    "Common usage: *recordar el pasado* (to remember the past), *recordaré este momento* (I will remember this moment)",
    "Don't confuse with **acordarse** (to remember - reflexive, used with \"de\")"
  ],
